+# PRE-REGISTRATION — REPLACE THE FOURTEEN, ROUND TO 300 (quant seat, 2026-08-23)
+Written before the 300 is scored. Base HEAD 4928020f5f2b · frame 46586cbb1671 · oracle 518862bf19fb imported · engine unchanged.
+Substitution only: the 297 minus the fourteen (indices 37,38,48,84,149,181 LONG / 205,208,226,230,231,256,270,296 SHORT, re-derived
+from the 19,754 field at HEAD this turn) plus fourteen replacements, 6 LONG / 8 SHORT, from the ordinary field
+(results_F0_triple_convergence_and_d2ddir.csv ∪ catalogue_F0.csv VALID), agg_pf >= 2.0, not already in the 297. No other row touched.
+
+## SELECTION RULE (mechanical)
+At-risk bars = control entry bars whose qualifying depth (build_signal_masks) falls below 3 without the fourteen: measured 1 LONG + 14 SHORT.
+Per direction:
+  1. GREEDY SET COVER of the at-risk bars: repeatedly take the candidate covering the most still-uncovered at-risk bars;
+     ties by agg_pf descending, then signal_def ascending. Stop when all covered or no candidate adds a bar.
+  2. FILL the remaining slots (to 6 LONG / 8 SHORT) by: at_risk_hit descending, control_bars_hit descending (fires on the most
+     control entry bars — restores depth where the fourteen did), agg_pf descending, signal_def ascending.
+Coverage first, PF second, directional balance fixed at 6/8 — as instructed.
+
+## SCORING
+One run: the 300 at the 297's object (FLOORED, cap 21, floor {1:3,-1:3}, tier gates per whole_dot_config.json, ATR>=20, conviction as
+config, recentfb False). IN-SAMPLE. Acceptance = the control line; a 300 with a losing week has failed whatever its net.
+Report order: loss events -> worst bar -> worst day -> losing weeks -> days -> entry bars -> trades -> WR -> PF -> MARGIN -> net; monthly table.
+Bookkeeping before this file: engine 201, statistical 18,841, solo 1,818. Planned: 1 engine run (+ the control already reproduced).
